  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/2042326d26ec7b593e52bbbdd22d890b59b1e59f92be81a7235509e9af1c4625.png] \n\nGiven equation : 56 ÷ 16 x 8 + 45 × 13 = 697 \n\nNow, by interchanging the numbers :\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : 8 and 13\n\n56 ÷ 16 x 8 + 45 × 13 = 697 ⇒ 56 ÷ 16 x 13 + 45 × 8 = 697\n\n**56 ÷**____** 16**__ x 13 + 45 × 8 = 697\n\n__**3.5 **____**x 13**__ + __**45 × 8**__ = 697\n\n__**45.5 + 360**__ = 697\n\n405.5 ≠ 697 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : 16 and 8​\n\n56 ÷ 16 x 8 + 45 × 13 = 697 ⇒ 56 ÷ 8 x 16 + 45 × 13 = 697\n\n**56 ÷**____** 8**__ x 16 + 45 × 13 = 697\n\n__**7 **____**x 16**__ + __**45 × 13**__ = 697\n\n__**112 + 585**__ = 697\n\n**697 = 697 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : 16 and 45 \n\n56 ÷ 16 x 8 + 45 × 13 = 697 ⇒ 56 ÷ 45 x 8 + 16 × 13 = 697\n\n**56 ÷**____** 45**__ x 8 + 16 × 13 = 697\n\n__**1.24 x 8**__ + __**16 × 13**__ = 697\n\n__**9.92 + 208**__ = 697\n\n217.92 ≠ 697 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : 8 and 45\n\n56 ÷ 16 x 8 + 45 × 13 = 697 ⇒ 56 ÷ 16 x 45 + 8 × 13 = 697 \n\n**56 ÷**____** 16**__ x 45 + 8 × 13 = 697\n\n__**3.5 x 45**__ + __**8 × 13**__ = 697\n\n__**157.5 + 104**__ = 697\n\n104 ≠ 697 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (2)\" is the correct answer.",
